The Flask research prototype was not evaluated.  However, assurance work
was done under both the Flask and the DTOS projects to assess the security
and assurability of the architecture and to investigate assurance
techniques to address novel aspects of the architecture. Reports about
that assurance work are accessible via the DTOS and Flask links on the
Background page (http://www.nsa.gov/selinux/background.html).

